    "The proposal is therefore NOT a lawful development.",
    "The proposed use of the dwellinghouse as a House of Multiple Occupancy (HMO) up to 7 person exceeds the limitations of Use Class C4 which limits the number of occupants to 6 persons. Therefore, the proposed development would fail to be within the tolerances of Class L of Part 3 of Schedule 2 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended)."
